{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '%s\\\\n' '[sol] 2026-10-22 20:52: Derived core F={0<=p_i<=v_i,sum p=P}. Let D=sum v-P, u_i=min(v_i,D), y_i=p_i-p_i\"'^VCG, r=sum u_i-D. F becomes {0<=y_i<=u_i,sum y=r}; nearest is projection of 0. For positive values, conjectured/provable exact equality: r<=min u_i (uncut equilateral triangle), OR u_A=u_B=u_C (permutation symmetry). Pairwise swap integration proves centroid coordinates strictly ordered when u_i<u_j and r>u_i, precluding equal projection coordinates. Zero-value degeneracies need separate handling; with <=2 positive winners equality always.'\"' >> /work/board.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
